C++ PROGRAMS-=====>

1->
Cin operator- Used for input predefined in <istream> [input stream] class.
Syntax:
cin>>variable;

2->
Cout operator- Used for output predefined in <ostream> [output stream] class.
Syntax:
cout<<"value"<<variable;

3->
endl- means next line.

4->
using namespace std;
The statement [ using namespace std; ] in C++ is a directive that brings all the names (like classes, functions, and objects) from the std namespace into the current scope.

